<title>USA: Specialty Equipment names president.</title>
<headline>Specialty Equipment names president.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Ill. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Equipment Cos Inc said Tuesday it named Jeffrey Rhodenbaugh as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Rhodenbaugh, who joined Specialty Equipment in 1986, most recently was president of Beverage-Air Co, a Specialty division.</p>
<p>Rhodenbaugh assumes responsibility from William Dotterweich, who will continue as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
